omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_rwFJzHwmxYQ7kNvwHQuvrp&_nc_oc=Adqh8BQ82NPv6xLhZged8NhqJ5oJO6QJB3NeJaaaTSjlYt2Mvm1nHD29kLOiCVPUZfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPSJAchI_S9_nhrdFIy-nr92YySs63LiTmXM1pZBI5Vmg&oe=6AC906B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bMk1i9hgctkQ7kNvwGvrCVo&_nc_oc=AdpPhFwku2mB0Qy6iU3-zF8ejgYIkEtofKgFYooxWRTL6jGZj8pnNH94eDLtgHz5SbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM_RsAiEivCqhy2ShYhBTjYDksVfhTcMFNkPLtLNr5NzA&oe=6AC90816"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R5BFpJNNA-gQ7kNvwGJ1e3S&_nc_oc=AdqxlDu9Dq-J8svTALJ5sVoXgiOz8ommfPr_QTee3xFAt6I1mvJFwfG_D8CaOXejdXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPS21qynUu3ddFE5TdWQOK49p16FY3HkYTx_F_Guajb4A&oe=6AC91D37"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://